# Completion Review: add-service-quota-config

## Fixed During Implementation

- Added quota/account/rotation fields to `broker.Service`; implementation location is `internal/broker`, not `internal/catalog`.
- Added account credential-key existence checks in service POST/PUT APIs using vault credential keys only; credential values are never read or returned.
- Added deterministic quota validation and skipped credential-list lookup when services have no account pool.

## Verification

- `openspec validate add-service-quota-config --strict`
- `go test ./internal/broker ./internal/server`
